<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- Illinois Student Commission.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- Illinois Student Commission.</headline>
<text>
<p>ILLINOIS STUDENT ASSISTANCE COMMISSION</p>
<p>RE: $3,365,000</p>
<p>STUDENT LOAN REVENUE BONDS, SENIOR SERIES LL</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: NAF		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>  DATED: 05/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON</p>
<p>03/01/2007		3,365M    5.75  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NOT SUJECT TO OPTIONAL REDEMPTION</p>
<p>FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION REGARDING THE EXTRAORDINARY</p>
<p>REDEMPTION PROVISIONS PLEASE REFER TO YOUR PRELIMINARY</p>
<p>OFFICIAL STATEMENT.</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award was received today Friday, January 24, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for May 5, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
